---
// 季刊订阅卡片：表单由 src/scripts/site/essays.ts 接管，保留原有 id 与 aria 属性。
---

<div class="card-inverse relative overflow-hidden p-6">
  <span class="font-label-sm text-[0.625rem] tracking-widest uppercase opacity-70 block mb-1 font-mono">
    QUARTERLY ZINE
  </span>
  <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-primary font-normal mb-2">风屿季刊投递</h4>
  <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-inverse-primary/80 mb-5 leading-relaxed">
    每季度末整理一份不公开的长文与私藏歌单，以信件形式投递至邮箱。
  </p>
  <form class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm" id="newsletter-form" novalidate>
    <input aria-hidden="true" autocomplete="off" class="hidden" name="website" tabindex="-1" type="text" />
    <label class="sr-only" for="newsletter-email">
      {' '}
      接收季刊的邮箱{' '}
    </label>
    <input
      class="min-h-11 w-full rounded-lg border border-on-inverse/25 bg-on-inverse/10 px-4 py-2.5 font-label-md text-label-md text-on-inverse placeholder:text-on-inverse/60 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-on-inverse/40"
      placeholder="your-email@campus.edu"
      type="email"
      id="newsletter-email"
      name="email"
      required
      aria-describedby="newsletter-note"
    />
    <button
      class="flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-surface px-4 py-2.5 font-label-md text-label-md font-medium text-primary transition-colors hover:bg-surface-container disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-60"
      type="submit"
    >
      <span class="">订阅候信</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">outgoing_mail</span>
    </button>
  </form>
  <p
    class="mt-3 font-label-sm text-label-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse/70"
    id="newsletter-note"
    role="status"
    aria-live="polite"
  >
    每季度一封，随时可以退订。也可以先用{' '}
    <a class="underline text-on-inverse" href="/rss.xml">
      {' '}
      RSS{' '}
    </a>{' '}
    把书房装进口袋。
  </p>
</div>
